[{"id":178570635,"discussion_id":"d278ede26c038c0678dc9a96847e8abb9540e4be","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*黄迪*](https://gitcode.com/kevin_huang1234), [*陈风*](https://gitcode.com/chenfeng61) (2/2) | ✅ [*黄迪*](https://gitcode.com/kevin_huang1234), [*陈风*](https://gitcode.com/chenfeng61) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n surezz, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-04T16:27:30+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-08T11:15:36+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178571127,"discussion_id":"ed53b18687819914d7ae1a1cff7b2f43928d7a35","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n该PR主要修复了 `IndexPutWithSortV2` 算子中SIMT模板和SIMD模板的计算逻辑问题。在SIMT内核(`index_put_with_sort_v2.h`)中，针对 `bool` 类型新增了专用的累加路径——使用 `|=` 按位或替代普通加法，并从已有输出值初始化累加器以确保与历史结果正确合并；同时对非全部索引化(`!ALL_INDEXED`)分支进行了结构重构，将多维索引分解移至外层循环，使内层 `do-while` 仅专注于同一排序键下的值累加。在SIMD内核(`index_put_with_sort_v2_simd.h`)中，简化了 `curCoreProcessColCount` 的计算逻辑，移除了 `colUseCoreNum_ == 1` 的特殊分支处理。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`bool` 类型累加逻辑修复（SIMT `ALL_INDEXED` 分支）**：当模板参数 `ACCUMULATE` 为真且 `TX` 为 `bool` 时，累加器 `accumValue` 改为从 `output[idxedSelfIdx]` 的现有值初始化，累加操作使用 `|=` 替代 `+=`，写回时直接赋值而非调用 `WriteBack`，确保布尔值的OR语义正确\n\n- **`bool` 类型累加逻辑修复（SIMT 非 `ALL_INDEXED` 分支）**：在 `for` 循环遍历非索引维度时，同样新增了 `bool` 类型的特殊处理——从 `output[selfOfst]` 读取现有值初始化 `accumValue`，使用 `|=` 累加，最后直接写回\n\n- **非 `ALL_INDEXED` 分支循环结构重构**：将 `innerStart`/`innerStep` 的计算和多维索引分解（`nonIdxedSelfIdx`/`nonIdxedValueIdx`）提至 `for` 循环体内、`do-while` 循环体外执行，使内层 `do-while` 仅迭代同一 `sortIndices` 键对应的索引值，避免重复计算索引偏移\n\n- **SIMD内核 `curCoreProcessColCount` 计算简化**：移除 `colUseCoreNum_ == 1` 时的单独赋值路径，统一使用 `(blockCol_ == colUseCoreNum_ - 1) ? colTailBlockFactor : colBlockFactor` 的三元表达式，消除了冗余分支\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-04T16:30:15+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-04T16:30:15+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178580578,"discussion_id":"8ca0c4174a28e433fbb2311c75f36123ef2355c0","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-04T17:22:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-04T17:22:23+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178967166,"discussion_id":"347f97179fdd60b5c11ed034281d1de3d024140f","body":"### Notification  \nThis pull request has been changed(code update) or closed, so remov